# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google services credentials — NEVER commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Firebase integration was removed on 2026-10-27: the challenge requires
# the app to make no network calls, and a distribution SDK linked into the
# binary would contradict that in the one place a reviewer checks first.
#
# These rules stay as a net. If one of these files is ever reintroduced by a
# tool or a tutorial, it must not reach the history of a public repository.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Local Docker image stamps (see Makefile)
.make/

# FVM: local SDK symlink (.fvmrc IS versioned, this is not)
.fvm/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artefacts — repo-wide safety net
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The per-platform .gitignore files under app/ are the primary rules. These
# repeat the important ones at the root so an artefact is still ignored when a
# build drops it somewhere unexpected — a failed Xcode build in particular
# scatters files outside the directory it was invoked from, and `git add .`
# then sweeps them in.

# Xcode
**/DerivedData/
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcresult
**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/

# CocoaPods (Podfile and Podfile.lock are committed; installed pods are not)
**/Pods/

# Flutter / Dart
**/.dart_tool/
**/ephemeral/
**/flutter_assets/
*.flx
*.dill
.flutter-versions

# Gradle / Android
**/.gradle/
**/captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex

# Signing material — these must NEVER be committed. The keystore belongs
# outside this repository entirely; see docs/android-build.md.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
**/key.properties

# OS noise
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent and tooling scratch — local only
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
