# never committed: it is not part of the software, and the repository should
# carry only what builds and documents the app.
.claude/
.claude-*/
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.md
.superpowers/
.playwright-mcp/
.serena/
.aider*
.cursor/
.windsurfrules
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Stray screenshots dropped in the repository root by iteration work.
/*.png
